?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22bdacb484243bbc42f66e9faf571d00 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ba3c7b72/uploads/origins/bbc5d45b-579a-4fa8-a1f5-3c569c0f66ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ffa2b4e1f2dfa2fc38cbbb20078134 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ba3c7b72/uploads/origins/bbc5d45b-579a-4fa8-a1f5-3c569c0f66ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc8be7fd4cc59abb1480513c2d33fe85", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ba3c7b72/uploads/origins/bbc5d45b-579a-4fa8-a1f5-3c569c0f66ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc8be7fd4cc59abb1480513c2d33fe85, https://si.imgix.net/ba3c7b72/uploads/origins/bbc5d45b-579a-4fa8-a1f5-3c569c0f66ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c74c5b96d188cbe70c3a5f7cf01a342b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ba3c7b72/uploads/origins/bbc5d45b-579a-4fa8-a1f5-3c569c0f66ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf405bcb881fc7a122e207a95a2d49c3 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you Tanupon.\n\nI have always liked your illustrations of Hololive, so I requested this.\nThis time, I would like to request that you draw my child, Tanuki-musume.\nThe following is a description of her appearance.\n\nAbout the appearance\nAttributes: Tanuki girl (so she has a tail and tanuki ears), long hair that almost reaches her waist, miko, blue eyes\nHair color (bright orange like sRGB#F44F12), with hair ornaments\nClothing: The description says \"miko\" in the attributes, but feel free to draw her in any way you like.\nI am also attaching a Tanuki-Musume that I have drawn in the past as reference material.\nThe appearance of each artist is different, so you are free to draw her as you like.\n\nThe situation, composition, etc. are all up to you.\nIf possible, we would be happy to have facial expression differences and the name of the person addressed on separate layers.\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/tanupon_fox/status/1492364160050823170?t=vY8krVaLnB8A6A-T9waXyw&s=19", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taraco_max/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 192953, "client_id": 1195902, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54724173f9657b11d8b21219dfabc009", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54724173f9657b11d8b21219dfabc009, https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=031ab4e529c24e286823f1872eb10a4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63f0cd46395d62b06966f032748cfe6b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65b974e0c599ab1dcafcca5a0ae5aecc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65b974e0c599ab1dcafcca5a0ae5aecc, https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a910ad1458ace9b9be73ea0122c77bf9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35508088/uploads/origins/10c277d0-6793-43b4-b6df-e84eff6ff292?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0bf6c776b3201fbbfabfe9c7e2ade34d 3x"}, "body": "Lovely illustrations.\nI always look forward to seeing them.\n\nI learned that you became a freelance illustrator\nI would like to make a request\nI would like to make a request to you.\n\nThis time, I would like to request \"Akua Minato\" who belongs to Hololive.\nThis time, I would like to request \"Akua Minato\" who belongs to Hololive.\nPlease choose a costume that is easy to draw.\nThe composition and situation\nI leave it to you.\n\nIf you can increase the number of people you can draw within the amount\nIf you can increase the number of\nI would be happy if you could draw a person who is good friends with Akua\nI would be happy if you could draw the person who is good friends with\n\nIf you are going to broadcast your drawing\nYou can also draw during the delivery.\n\nIf you can prepare the difference\nPosting fanart on Twitter is OK\nPosting on skeb and pixiv is OK\n\nIt would be great if you could tell us who made the request\nI'd be happy if you could tell me who the request is from.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@taraco_max/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 192953, "client_id": 40610, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2a920ab/uploads/origins/a6425f99-6dcf-4ceb-b903-baa847c7f44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4b1167e6aa3cbe6966915779d4370bb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2a920ab/uploads/origins/a6425f99-6dcf-4ceb-b903-baa847c7f44c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4b1167e